# The site's build context. BuildKit reads this file for website/Dockerfile in place of the root .dockerignore — which
# leaves docs/ out of the server's image, and the site needs it: the guide's source, the changelog and the site itself,
# without what npm installs or the build makes.
*
!CHANGELOG.md
!docs
!website
website/node_modules
website/dist
website/.astro
website/src/content/docs
